WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Before editing query.py, inspect the files that depend on it.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Aletheore resolves five non-test import dependents in this scan.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Local scanning needs no Aletheore account or model API key.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Enabled registry checks and scanner integrations can use the network.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The deterministic scanner builds structure before an AI model reasons.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:45.000
air.json and air.toon hold the evidence used by downstream tools.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The result includes the file, symbol, line range, and source.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
This function uses file-scoped ownership when a target is supplied.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The CLI, dashboard, MCP server, and tool router depend on this file.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Static imports are useful context; runtime loading can leave gaps.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Related tests are separated by the strength of their relationship.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
These are candidates. The command does not execute tests or prove coverage.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:46.500
The local dashboard exposes the dependency graph and scan history.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Use it to investigate structure alongside the targeted CLI answers.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Run aletheore mcp-install . --target cursor to configure Cursor.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:12.000
MCP returns repository evidence; your agent remains responsible for reasoning.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:21.000
The GitHub App can post source-linked findings on pull requests.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:30.000
This historical finding was marked no longer detected after a later commit.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.500
Hosted features include AI-marked symbol docs and AIRview architecture pages.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:45.000
Endpoint monitoring adds source context. Check current plan availability.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:52.500
Start locally, inspect the evidence, then connect the workflow you need.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:03:00.000
Scan → source → dependents → candidate tests → agent → PR review.
